  "description_short": "Mediterranean flavours meet Garden Route charm at this relaxed Wilderness spot with coffee, cocktails and all-day dining.",
  "description_long": "Tucked on the corner of Beacon Road and Leila's Lane, Blue Olive brings a taste of the Mediterranean to the heart of Wilderness. The relaxed atmosphere works equally well for morning coffee and pastries, a leisurely lunch, or sundowners at the bar. The menu roams from Greek-inspired mezze platters to wood-fired pizzas, fresh salads, and hearty grills, with something for every appetite and occasion.\n\nThe setting is casual and welcoming, with both indoor and outdoor seating that catches the Garden Route breeze. Families appreciate the child-friendly vibe, while groups and functions find plenty of space to settle in. Whether you're stopping in for a quick espresso or lingering over a bottle of wine, Blue Olive delivers consistent, unpretentious fare in a spot that feels like a local favourite.\n\nWith its central Wilderness location and all-day menu, it's an easy choice for breakfast, lunch, or an early dinner. The kitchen keeps things simple and satisfying, with enough variety to bring you back more than once during your stay on the Garden Route.",
